    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nO'Shea O'Toole present a rare opportunity to acquire a site with full planning permission for a detached house situated within a short walk of the picturesque fishing village and popular tourist destination of Dunmore East. The site is approximately 800m from Lawlor's Beach / The Strand, and convenient to the village's park, harbour, restaurants and cliff walks.\n\nThe site extends to 0.041 hectares (0.10 acre) and benefits from full planning permission for a detached dwelling of 134 sq.m over three levels. Planning permission (Ref: 26/60249) was granted by Waterford City and County Council in June 2026.\n\nAccommodation comprises hall, guest w.c., with large open-plan kitchen / dining / living room at ground floor level. A large bedroom with walk-in wardrobe and en-suite is provided at first floor level, with a further bedroom and en-suite at second floor level.\n\nConnections to mains water and mains sewerage are available to the site. A development contribution of 3,770 is payable to the local authority as a condition of the grant of permission. Title folio number WD26970F.\n\nPlease note: the red outline shown on the accompanying images is indicative only and does not represent the precise site boundary. Interested parties should rely on the boundaries as set out in the planning documentation.\n\nFor further information please email info@osheaotoole.com\n\n"
      },
      {
